required by the legislation of the Republic of Kazakhstan or other medical 
examinations established by the University’s internal regulations.  
3.3.2. In cases of termination of residence, payments made for accommodation 
are non-refundable, except in cases specified in subparagraphs 1)-4) of Clause 3.3.1. 
of these Policy and Procedures. 

3.4. Eviction from the dormitory 

3.4.1. Eviction of the student/resident assistant from the dormitory, as a 
disciplinary measure, is applied in the following cases:  
1) If it is discovered that the student/resident assistant provided false, 
forged, or misleading information/documents that served as the basis for granting a 
place in the dormitory;   
2) If the student is absent from the dormitory for 5 (five) consecutive 
calendar days without prior notification to the University and the Entity, except in 
cases of valid reasons (such as illness, natural disasters, military actions, the death of 
a close relative, etc.) with supporting documentation; 
3) If the student/resident assistant fails to fulfill or improperly fulfills their 
obligations under the Accommodation Services Agreement, leading to its termination 
at the initiative of the Entity; 
